# Secrets. app/.streamlit/secrets.toml exists in this working tree and has never
# been committed; this is what keeps a `git add -A` from being the first time.
#
# `**/` and not `.streamlit/secrets.toml`: a pattern containing a slash is
# anchored to this file's directory, so the unanchored-looking version would
# have covered the root copy and missed app/'s — which is the one that exists.
# Verified with `git check-ignore -v`.
**/.streamlit/secrets.toml
secrets.toml
.env
*.pem
*.key

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/

# macOS, and Finder's clipboard files — several are already in the tree
.DS_Store
*.textClipping
.Rhistory

# Generated at run time, not source.
backend/slurm_logs/
backend/slurm_manifests/
work/
.nextflow*/

# Data and derived artifacts. These are large, are rebuilt by the pipeline, and
# are only meaningful next to the embeddings they came from.
*.h5
*.h5ad
*.npz
*.sif
h5_exports/
loaded_data/

# The reference profile is derived from a reference by validate_reference.py
# --save-profile, and is pinned to one reference plus one vote configuration —
# so it belongs beside the reference, not in git.
*_profile_*.json

# --- Data, 2026-08-26 --------------------------------------------------------
# ~600 MB of CSV exports, dumps and derived artifacts sit untracked in this
# working tree. They are one `git add -A` from permanent history, and several
# carry patient-adjacent content. Named here so that stays impossible rather
# than merely unlikely.

# Node's dependency tree — 64 MB, thousands of files, rebuilt by `npm install`.
node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# Database dumps. hpl_kb_dump.pgsql is a real dump of the Knowledge Bank.
*.pgsql
*.dump

# The CSV exports the KB was originally hand-loaded from (353 MB), plus the
# per-tile embedding exports. Derived from the pipeline; regenerable; far past
# what belongs in git.
csv_files/
tile_reg.csv
tile_reg_dup.csv
tile_coords_with_h5_index.csv
wsi_metadata.csv
wsi_registry.csv
TCGA_LUAD_5x_he_train_filtered_leiden_2p5__fold2.csv
TCGA_55_7574_final_tile_coordinates*.csv

# GDC clinical download — patient-level clinical data. Never in git.
clinical.project-*/

# Trained model weights and the heatmap working directory. The .keras
# checkpoint behind tile_hpc_heatmap lives here; it is a binary artifact with
# no provenance recorded anywhere, which is its own problem, but not one git
# should absorb.
Heatmap/
*.keras
heatmap_table

# Word/Office lock files Finder leaves behind.
~$*
